# The HYDAT archive: 1.2 GB, fetched by `fetch_data.py --layers hydat` and re-fetchable
# from ECCC whenever the release moves. It was untracked and UNIGNORED, which is a trap in
# a repo where more than one agent runs `git add -A` — `data/hydat.release` records which
# release the committed envelope was built from, and that is the part worth keeping.
data/hydat.sqlite3
